      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I will admit it is odd that the call is going out so close to the event this year. Just looked back through the history and it was March last year that they started collecting names for both Gen Con and Seattle PAX. I spent some idle brain cycles on it this morning, best guess I could come up with was that booth size negotiation was still underway, so GTG didn&#39;t want to start racking up names until they knew how many demos they&#39;d be running.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Well, actually that was my second best guess. What I actually think is that Craig has perfected a cloning process that allows him to make as many literal booth-monkeys as he needs. But people gave me weird looks when I tried to explain it.</p>",
